{"root":{"data":{"id":"diiuu6h5lo80","created":1778808079410,"text":"溯源分析"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"diivms8k5y00","created":1778810320976,"text":"情报收集"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"diivmwlb1f40","created":1778810330454,"text":"document_search.py"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"diivn5xytqg0","created":1778810350811,"text":"PDF→Markdown→结构化分块→倒排索引，\n再用 短语 + TF-IDF 风格 + 标题加分 做排序检索，\n并用 顺序相邻 chunk 提供上下文，\n适合本地报告类 PDF 的快速可查阅读，而非语义向量检索。","layout_right_offset":{"x":-12.999999612569923,"y":-50.99999848008167}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"diiw84zr4f40","created":1778811994389,"text":"rag_search.py"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"diiw8ov9pwg0","created":1778812037654,"text":"在本地持久化的 Chroma 向量库（默认 chroma_db）里，\n用 OpenAId的text-embedding-ada-002 把查询句编成向量，做 similarity_search，\n返回最相近的若干条文档片段（page_content + metadata）。\n不负责建索引或写 PDF——向量库需事先建好。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"diiwbnxjrtk0","created":1778812270708,"text":"业界SOC情报查询"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"diiwc2ztl540","created":1778812303497,"text":"结构化 IOC 仍走专用平台；本地报告用 OpenSearch + 可选向量 或 BM25+向量混合；RAG 侧加 metadata 过滤（时间、来源、TLP） 和 重排，而不是单靠当前单一检索路径。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"diiw7pt3i8w0","created":1778811961335,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}